## New Feature

We need OneRec to support reconciliation between different dates:

Left = Tn
Right = Tn + N

Where N is metadata/configuration driven and could be 1, 2, 3, etc.

Example:

Right/current available date = 28
Configured offset = 3

Then:

LeftDate = 25
RightDate = 28

Reconciliation should perform:

Left(25) vs Right(28)

Both datasets are assumed to already exist before reconciliation execution.

This is NOT future-data lookup.

Existing same-date reconciliations must continue to work unchanged.

